SUMMARY:Maple Magic &amp; Winter Wonder at the Botanical Garden
DESCRIPTION:Maple Magic &amp; Winter Wonder takes place daily from October 1 through December 31\, 2026\, from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. at Sonoma Botanical Garden. Experience the changing seasons as vibrant autumn foliage gives way to the brilliant colors of rare Asian maples and the peaceful beauty of early winter. Throughout the season\, visitors can enjoy guided walks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the Garden’s evolving landscape. Wander among colorful fall foliage\, breathe in the sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, explore creative programs\, and discover the Garden’s tranquil beauty as it transitions into winter. Each visit offers something new to experience\, making Maple Magic &amp; Winter Wonder a memorable seasonal celebration of nature\, creativity\, and connection.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/maple-magic-winter-wonder-at-the-botanical-garden/
LOCATION:12841 HWY 12, Glen Ellen, CA, 95442, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Outdoors,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/08/23065518/fall_college_tour.jpg
END:VEVENT
