SUMMARY:The Harvest Circle at The WELL Sanctuary
DESCRIPTION:The Harvest Circle: Well\, Wealthy &amp; Wise is an intimate autumn gathering in downtown Petaluma\, guided by Holly Shantara. Part of The W.E.L.L. Series\, the evening celebrates wisdom\, energy\, leadership and legacy while inviting guests to reflect on personal growth and set intentions for the future. Activities include a seasonal teaching\, guided visualization\, sharing circle\, grounding ritual and a personal intuitive micro-reading for each guest. An optional cacao ceremony is also available. No prior experience is necessary\, and guests are welcome to come as they are. Doors open at 6 p.m.\, with seating limited to 16 participants.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/the-harvest-circle-at-the-well-sanctuary/
LOCATION:47 6th Street , Petaluma, CA, 94952  ​, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Harvest Event,Sonoma County,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/11/14133239/group.png
END:VEVENT
