SUMMARY:Big Brother and the Holding Company at Spancky's Bar
DESCRIPTION:Big Brother and the Holding Company at Spancky's Bar brings a legendary piece of music history back to life. More than 50 years after the band performed at the former Inn of the Beginning\, Big Brother returns to the historic stage\, a portion of which remains part of Spancky's Bar today. The performance offers a nostalgic evening celebrating the band's musical legacy and its connection to the local music scene.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/big-brother-and-the-holding-company-at-spanckys-bar/
LOCATION:8201 Old Redwood Hwy, Cotati, CA, 94931, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/11/11181758/BBHC-Carson.jpg
