SUMMARY:Holiday Open House at Grand Cru Custom Crush
DESCRIPTION:Holiday Open House + Marketplace at Grand Cru Custom Crush offers a festive afternoon of wine tasting\, holiday shopping and local food. Guests can sample wines from participating wineries\, browse unique gifts from local makers and artisans\, and enjoy food and charcuterie while supporting small businesses.    Participating wineries include Aston Estate\, Bienvenue\, Boars’ View\, Bruliam\, Bucher\, Copper Six\, Fat Dragon\, DuMOL\, Jeff Cohn\, Moret Brealynn\, Parea and Stringer\, with additional wineries to be announced. The holiday marketplace features local vendors offering distinctive gifts\, handcrafted goods and specialty products.    Tickets include admission and wine tastings from participating wineries. Food\, additional wine purchases and marketplace items are available for purchase separately. The event provides an opportunity to discover local wines\, find holiday gifts and celebrate the season with the community.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/holiday-open-house-at-grand-cru-custom-crush/
LOCATION:1200 American Way, Windsor, CA, 95492
CATEGORIES:Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Holiday,Sonoma County,Tastings,Wine,Wine Tasting
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/10/13095358/486393235_1397189064925440_5200742923635976235_n-1.jpg
