SUMMARY:Booked &amp; Bottled: Build a Blind Date at Coursey Graves
DESCRIPTION:Booked &amp; Bottled at Coursey Graves Estate Winery pairs wine tasting with the fun of discovering a mystery book. Guests sample wines matched to literary genres\, including Chardonnay with historical fiction\, Sonoma Coast Pinot Noir with romantasy\, Syrah with contemporary fiction\, and Napa Cabernet with thrillers.    After choosing a favorite pour\, guests select a mystery book and personalize it with book-themed extras such as bookmarks\, stickers\, and tea. Each book is wrapped and includes a pairing card explaining the connection between the wine and story. The book remains a surprise until unwrapped at home.    Tickets include a wine flight\, a full glass of wine\, food\, a wrapped book with accessories\, book-themed games\, and access to a book swap. Additional mystery books are available for purchase.    Limited to 50 tickets. Ages 21 and older.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/booked-bottled-build-a-blind-date-at-coursey-graves/
LOCATION:6860 Serenity Way, Santa Rosa, CA, 95404, United States
CATEGORIES:Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Sonoma County,Wine,Wine Tasting
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/10/30185156/IMG_0302.jpg
END:VEVENT
