SUMMARY:Holiday Happy Hour at Charles M. Schulz Museum
DESCRIPTION:Holiday Happy Hour at the Schulz Museum invites adults 21+ to sip Coppola wine while creating a holiday‑themed Peanuts shadow box inspired by the Museum’s Peek‑a‑boo Box exhibit. Guests explore the galleries\, learn simple layered paper techniques\, and craft their own festive keepsake.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/holiday-happy-hour-at-charles-m-schulz-museum/
