SUMMARY:Wine Tasting Party for Singles 40+ at Bienvenue
DESCRIPTION:The Wine Tasting Party for Singles 40+ at Bienvenue Vineyards Wine Lounge offers an opportunity for single wine lovers to mingle and make new connections in a relaxed setting. Guests can enjoy three complimentary wine tastings\, participate in a fun mixer game\, and bring a friend at no additional cost. Hosted by the Society of Single Professionals and SinglesBayArea\, the event also supports the Seva Foundation\, which works to restore sight to people experiencing blindness. Free street parking is available\, and the SMART train provides convenient access.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/wine-tasting-party-for-singles-40-at-bienvenue-vineyards/
LOCATION:834 McClelland Drive , Windsor, CA, 95492, United States
CATEGORIES:Drink,Sonoma County,Wine,Wine Tasting
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/11/10180158/nov22_square.jpg
