SUMMARY:The Grateful Gathering at Sebastopol Center
DESCRIPTION:The Grateful Gathering: A Thanksgiving Celebration of The Grateful Dead brings a festive evening of live music honoring the Grateful Dead\, Jerry Garcia and beyond. Led by Marcus Rezak\, leader of the Grateful Dead tribute project Shred Is Dead\, the performance features an accomplished lineup of musicians with connections to Umphrey’s McGee\, Trey Anastasio Band\, Phil Lesh and other notable artists. A graduate of Berklee and DePaul\, Rezak is known for his improvisational style and high-energy performances.     The celebration also features Anna Elva\, Steve Pile\, Stephanie Salva\, Steven Younger\, Sam Betty and Matt Petruska. The event serves as a fundraiser for Sebastopol Center for the Arts.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/the-grateful-gathering-at-sebastopol-center-for-the-arts/
LOCATION:282 S. High Street, Sebastopol, CA, 95472, United States
GEO:-122.825271;38.400121
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/11/13220558/20260322_192411.jpg
