SUMMARY:Petaluma Holiday Food Fair at Hall of the Above
DESCRIPTION:The 10th Annual Petaluma Holiday Food Fair brings dozens of local food makers together under one roof for an afternoon of holiday shopping and tasting. Visitors can browse a variety of locally made products\, including cheese\, bread\, charcuterie\, chocolate\, honey\, preserves\, wine\, and spirits\, with the opportunity to shop directly from the makers.    For the first time\, the annual event takes place at Barber Lee Spirits Distillery in downtown Petaluma\, where guests can also sample the distillery’s spirits and enjoy seasonal cocktails and other beverages amid festive holiday decorations. Free tickets are required\, with reservations offered in 15-minute entry intervals to help manage attendance. Children do not need tickets.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/petaluma-holiday-food-fair-at-hall-of-the-above/
LOCATION:199 Petaluma Blvd North, Petaluma, 94952
CATEGORIES:Benefit,Drink,Family Friendly,Food,Food & Wine,Holiday,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2025/11/02134124/feastpic.jpg
END:VEVENT
